<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44070" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sexĭes</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-ĭens</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>num. adv.</i> [sex]. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Six times</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hostis sexies victus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 4,
					32</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">id sexies evenit per annos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 16, 43, § 146</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hoc sexies ducendum est,</span>”
				<i>is to be taken six times</i>, <i>to be multiplied
						by six</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Col. 5,
					2 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> For sextum, <i>for the sixth time</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mario sexies Valerioque Flacco Coss.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vell.
					1, 15, 5</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
